    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## cezar lifecycle \u2014 n8n 2.43.4\nRaw bytes and signature headers are forwarded unchanged to the supplied single-process webhook-relay.mjs. That relay verifies HMAC/time, serializes event IDs, reads completed IDs, posts to chat, durably records success, then answers. This workflow returns that status only afterwards. Never enable immediate response or automatic node retries. Configure the relay URL and persistent store before activation. Multiple n8n executions must use the SAME relay instance and key trust domain. See the release-matched webhooks.md guide.",
        "height": 290,
        "width": 780
